<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>Hero's Quest - Tor-AI</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/game-layout.css">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            touch-action: none;
            -webkit-touch-callout: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            user-select: none;
        }
        #game-container {
            background-color: #222;
            touch-action: none;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
        }
    </style>
    <!-- Phaser 3 CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/phaser@3.60.0/dist/phaser.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="game-layout">
        <aside class="sidebar left-sidebar">
            <div class="user-profile">
                <p>플레이어: <strong><%= user.username %></strong></p>
                <p>내 최고 점수: <span id="my-best-score"><%= user.best_score %></span></p>
                <p>플레이 횟수: <span id="my-attempts"><%= user.hero_attempts %></span></p>
                <p>내 현재 순위: <span id="my-rank">-</span></p>
            </div>
            <div class="motivational-phrases" id="motivation">
                <p>"영웅이여, 전설을 써 내려가라!"</p>
                <p>"끝까지 포기하지 마세요!"</p>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <a href="/dashboard" class="main-btn" style="text-decoration:none; display:inline-block; border:1px solid #fff; color:#fff; padding:5px 15px; font-size:12px;">대시보드로 돌아가기</a>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <main class="game-area">
            <div id="game-container"></div>
        </main>

        <aside class="sidebar right-sidebar">
            <h3>명예의 전당 (Top 10)</h3>
            <div class="leaderboard" id="top10">
                <!-- Top 10 users -->
            </div>
            
            <h3>내 경쟁자들</h3>
            <div class="leaderboard" id="rivals">
                <!-- Similar score users -->
            </div>
        </aside>
    </div>

    <!-- Game Scripts -->
    <script src="/games/hero-quest/js/audio.js"></script>
    <script src="/games/hero-quest/js/assets.js"></script>
    <script src="/games/hero-quest/js/levels.js"></script>
    <script src="/games/hero-quest/js/entities.js"></script>
    <script src="/games/hero-quest/js/game.js"></script>
    
    <script src="/js/scoreboard.js"></script>
    <script>
        // Track attempts for this game
        fetch('/api/increment-attempts', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ game: 'hero' })
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
